  "summary": "Berkeley police charged Derrick Sparks with felony stalking after he allegedly harassed his ex-girlfriend with hundreds of calls and violated a restraining order. Flock ALPR alerts in Emeryville and San Francisco helped locate his vehicle, leading to his arrest by SFPD on Aug. 8.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "Flock cameras later helped Emeryville police spot the vehicle outside a hotel in their city, BPD said.",
      "paragraph_idx": 11
    },
    {
      "quote": "San Francisco police arrested Sparks on Aug. 8, with the help of a department drone, after getting their own Flock alert, police said.",
      "paragraph_idx": 12
    }
